<title>USA: Utd Illuminating to loan funds for buyback.</title>
<headline>Utd Illuminating to loan funds for buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HAVEN, Conn. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Illuminating Co said on Tuesday that the Connecticut Department of Public Utility Control approved the company's plan to loan up to $15 million to the company's employee stock ownership plan to buy common stock.</p>
<p>The shares will be repurchased through open market transactions or privately negotiated deals depending on market conditions, United Illuminating said.</p>
<p>As of June 30, 1997, 14.1 million shares were outstanding. Based on the current market price, about 500,000 shares could be purchased, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
